WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:49.480
Someone once said...

00:01:50.050 --> 00:01:55.560
There are seven-flavored turkeys who, 
whenever they spread their wings,

00:01:55.560 --> 00:01:58.030
sprinkle seven flavored sweet and hot spices,

00:01:58.030 --> 00:02:00.960
ever increasing the deliciousness 
of their meat...

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:05.070
The Seven-Flavored Turkey!

00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:09.040
There are cotton fields 
whose fluff is cotton candy

00:02:09.040 --> 00:02:13.370
made from sweet, tangy 100% apricot juice...

00:02:13.370 --> 00:02:17.110
The Apricotton Field!

00:02:18.050 --> 00:02:21.180
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:21.180 --> 00:02:26.020
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:31.890
Right when Toriko and the others 
were going to escape from Ice Hell,

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:34.630
the Gourmet Corp.'s 
garçon, Alfaro, appeared,

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:37.000
and attempted to finish off Toriko,

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:40.400
but the living Gourmet 
National Treasure, Setsuno,

00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:42.400
stopped him with a single shout!

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:47.440
The Gourmet Corp. slipped 
away with the soup in hand.

00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:52.350
Coco and Setsuno had come to meet 
up with Toriko and the others,

00:02:52.350 --> 00:02:55.080
and they all had a warm feast together,

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:57.350
enjoying each other's company for a time.

00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:03.520
Toriko and the rest who had 
risked life and limb in Ice Hell

00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:06.390
make a beeline to the healing country, Life.

00:03:07.060 --> 00:03:08.930
Komatsu splits from the group

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:12.730
and heads to the Hotel Gourmet 
to make the Century Soup.

00:03:13.530 --> 00:03:20.040
And Toriko heads toward Teppei's master, 
a Gourmet Reviver, for treatment!

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:27.350
Splendid Healing! Here Comes 
the Gourmet Reviver, Yosaku!

00:03:32.680 --> 00:03:36.250
So this is the healing country, Life...

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:40.730
This is gonna be fun!

00:03:41.190 --> 00:03:44.500
Is there a lot of delicious 
food in this country, Teppei?

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:48.230
We're not here to eat, Toriko!

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:52.070
There is medicine in this 
country to treat any illness...

00:03:52.070 --> 00:03:55.640
Just a little longer... 
Hang in there, you guys!

00:03:57.040 --> 00:04:00.280
Looks like there's a whole bunch 
of injured people like us...

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:04.510
Injured and ill people from 
around the world gather here...

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:10.820
This is a place of hope, where all 
people come for a natural cure...

00:04:11.620 --> 00:04:15.460
For your information, 
that's a Natural Hospital

00:04:15.460 --> 00:04:17.630
that uses treatments found in nature.

00:04:18.630 --> 00:04:20.660
Ooh, acupuncture!

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:22.230
I'm gonna check it out!

00:04:22.230 --> 00:04:25.170
We don't have time for side trips!

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:26.070
Yo...

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:27.270
What the heck?!

00:04:27.270 --> 00:04:31.770
Welcome. We have bed-shaped Doctor Cacti.

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:33.110
Cacti?!

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:38.610
Doctor Cactus

00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:36.380
If you sleep on this, the spines hit 
pressure points all over your body,

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:38.510
and all your stiffness will 
melt away in an instant!

00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:40.850
Okay! Let's try it!

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:43.520
This is...

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:45.020
Thanks, come again!

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:49.760
That felt great!

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:51.460
Hot Spring Sharks?

00:04:51.460 --> 00:04:52.760
What the heck?

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:54.300
Let's check it out!

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:55.760
Hey, Toriko!

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:59.030
W-What?! There are sharks in the river?

00:04:58.970 --> 00:05:02.740
Hot Springs Shark

00:04:59.030 --> 00:05:05.270
These sharks spray out hot water from 
the holes in their recessed backs

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:09.410
and we have many Doctor Fish 
swimming in this famous hot spring.

00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:11.150
Doctor Fish

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:13.280
They will eat anything that 
is causing harm to your body.

00:05:13.280 --> 00:05:15.150
It looks like this shark hot spring

00:05:15.150 --> 00:05:18.050
has fish in it that will 
eat the dirt off your skin.

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:21.190
Hey! The water's fine!

00:05:21.190 --> 00:05:22.020
Zombie?!

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:23.490
It's Zonge, damn it!

00:05:24.790 --> 00:05:28.500
There's a ton of Doctor Fish coming!

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:32.070
What's this? You dare try to 
capture the great Zonge-sama?!

00:05:32.070 --> 00:05:33.730
What the heck is he doing?

00:05:33.730 --> 00:05:35.970
Which one of you was it?

00:05:35.970 --> 00:05:39.940
By the way, Immunity Tetra 
swim in this hot spring.

00:05:39.740 --> 00:05:43.480
Immunity Tetra

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:43.840
They are fish that'll suck 
up any virus in your body.

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:45.350
What's this?

00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:46.610
Skin lightening.

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:47.510
Skin lightening?

00:05:47.510 --> 00:05:51.790
Yes. In this hot spring swim Melanin Grammy.

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:52.850
Melanin Grammy

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:57.060
If I recall, these fish suck up the dark 
pigments and give you lighter skin.

00:05:58.020 --> 00:06:01.330
Bet Sunny would like this. Maybe 
I'll tell him about it next time.

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:06.870
Heaven!

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:15.540
What the...

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:16.240
I'm sorry!

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:18.680
Sunny!

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:18.680
Toriko!

00:06:19.780 --> 00:06:23.520
Didn't think I'd run into you here, Sunny...

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:25.550
You injured or something?

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:27.220
As if.

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:29.020
Thank you for waiting!

00:06:29.020 --> 00:06:30.790
Here are your Cuticle Berries.

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:34.560
Ooh! Strawberries that make 
your hair shiny and strong?

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:39.160
Life is not just a country where you 
come to cure injuries and illness.

00:06:39.660 --> 00:06:44.200
It also has beautification 
ingredients that are totally max...

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:46.440
Here for a beauty treatment?

00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:48.810
I never thought Sunny, one of the Four Kings,

00:06:48.810 --> 00:06:50.340
would be such a namby-pamby weakling.

00:06:50.740 --> 00:06:54.580
Don't push it, Match. He'll blow 
you away with a Hair Punch.

00:06:54.880 --> 00:06:57.520
Is that really all you're after?

00:06:58.180 --> 00:07:01.090
I've seen enough Gourmet 
Hunters in my day to know...

00:07:01.450 --> 00:07:05.420
You have the eyes of someone 
that's come to hunt.

00:07:08.390 --> 00:07:09.960
And... you are?

00:07:10.890 --> 00:07:12.830
Just kiddin', I know.

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:14.600
You're famous after all, Teppe.

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:15.670
Teppe?

00:07:15.670 --> 00:07:19.500
I came here to get information 
about a certain ingredient.

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:23.070
To get a hint about the ingredient 
that'll become the Dessert,

00:07:23.070 --> 00:07:25.180
the final dish on my Full Course menu!

00:07:25.180 --> 00:07:28.450
Oh? You decided on the ingredient 
that'll become your dessert?

00:07:28.450 --> 00:07:30.380
Then your Full Course will be completed soon!

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:33.280
Then... Why have you come to Life?

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:35.120
Huh?

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:38.050
What the hell?! You're 
wounded! Like, seriously!

00:07:38.050 --> 00:07:39.720
You're seriously wounded!

00:07:39.720 --> 00:07:42.190
Hey! Try noticing a little sooner!

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:45.760
Aha... You came to heal that big wound...

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:48.160
But come on... This might 
be the healing country,

00:07:48.160 --> 00:07:49.800
but they can't grow back an arm, you know?

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:53.000
My master might be able to 
do something about that.

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:54.440
Master? Who?

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:56.940
The Gourmet Reviver Yosaku.

00:07:58.440 --> 00:07:59.580
It's not just Toriko.

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:03.250
We've got some seriously injured people 
who we're going to ask to be treated.

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:08.420
Oh yeah, Takimaru... Maybe he has 
that medicine you wanted, too?

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:11.620
You know, that'll ease any illness...

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:17.790
But even if they had it, I 
don't have the money to buy it.

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:20.030
Then you just gotta take it!

00:08:20.030 --> 00:08:21.860
Uh, <i>take</i> it...?

00:08:21.860 --> 00:08:23.160
You'll handle it somehow.

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:24.100
Right, Teppei?

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:26.030
Don't ask me!

00:08:26.030 --> 00:08:29.700
It seems like the person 
you have business with

00:08:29.700 --> 00:08:33.810
is the same person who has 
the information I need.

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:42.150
The man who knows the Dessert of the 
Gourmet God Acacia's Full Course, Earth!

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:46.290
The Red Reviver, also known 
as "Yosaku, the Bloodstained!"

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:49.420
Never would have thought 
him to be Teppe's master...

00:08:49.420 --> 00:08:51.730
Sir, you're causing a scene...

00:08:51.730 --> 00:08:54.190
That kind of eating inside the store is...

00:08:54.190 --> 00:08:55.830
It's not allowed or something?

00:08:55.830 --> 00:08:58.770
Man... Speak of the devil...

00:08:58.770 --> 00:09:02.940
Passion Pork is meant to 
be eaten in a single gulp!

00:09:02.940 --> 00:09:07.240
But our restaurant is one where 
you eat with a knife and a fork...

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:10.940
Then let's break that rule, shall we?

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:14.710
In this world, you'll miss 
half the view otherwise!

00:09:14.710 --> 00:09:15.850
Master!

00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:18.450
That voice...

00:09:22.890 --> 00:09:25.620
Teppei! You're back?

00:09:26.890 --> 00:09:28.630
I knew it!

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:33.630
I knew the Gourmet Show 
Window was already gone.

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:35.230
Come on, break out a belly laugh!

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:37.370
Belly laugh?

00:09:37.370 --> 00:09:40.640
Too bad... But all ingredients 
have an expiration date.

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:42.040
This is fate.

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:44.110
You could call it the rule of the world.

00:09:44.110 --> 00:09:49.210
But I just might break that rule...

00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:50.620
Master!

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:54.820
Granny Setsu was seriously angry 
that you didn't go yourself, Master!

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:56.720
What?! Is Granny Setsu here?

00:09:56.720 --> 00:09:58.720
That's a violation of the rules!

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:00.390
Breaking the rules isn't allowed!

00:10:00.390 --> 00:10:01.760
What rule is that?

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:04.830
Sir, speaking too loudly 
is against the rules.

00:10:03.190 --> 00:10:04.830
This is Yosaku...

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:07.800
Looks like rules don't apply to him.

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:13.200
That damn Gourmet Corp. went and 
tried to steal the Century Soup, eh?

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:17.070
Thankfully, Komatsu-kun was 
able to drink the final drop.

00:10:17.070 --> 00:10:23.210
If they drink the soup, the level of 
their Gourmet Cells will surely rise.

00:10:23.710 --> 00:10:28.350
It means they're a step closer 
to ruling the Gourmet Age...

00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:34.830
But the Gourmet Corp.'s ultimate 
goal is not the Century Soup.

00:10:35.230 --> 00:10:38.360
The ingredient they are really after is...

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:40.000
...GOD.

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:44.770
The strength of you Four Heavenly Kings 
will be needed now more than ever.

00:10:45.100 --> 00:10:46.970
Where is Toriko now?

00:10:46.970 --> 00:10:49.240
He went to the healing country, Life.

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:51.570
Was he injured that badly?

00:10:51.570 --> 00:10:53.540
I pray that he recovers, however...

00:10:54.440 --> 00:10:55.980
Toriko's been hurt bad?!

00:10:55.980 --> 00:10:58.610
Rin! Did you just say handsome?!

00:10:58.610 --> 00:11:00.050
This sucks!

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:02.050
Johannes!

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:02.690
Yes?

00:11:11.760 --> 00:11:14.860
W-Well, well, Setsuno-sama!

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:16.100
Please, this way!

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:18.730
Hey, drop everything and wait on her!

00:11:18.730 --> 00:11:21.670
It's fine, it's fine... 
I'll be heading back soon.

00:11:21.670 --> 00:11:24.870
But this is not a bad hotel at all...

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:26.640
...Komatsu-kun.

00:11:26.640 --> 00:11:28.740
T-Thank you very much!

00:11:28.740 --> 00:11:33.450
Um, if you have the time, would you 
like to try the food at my restaurant?

00:11:33.450 --> 00:11:37.650
It might be a little impertinent of me, 
but if I can pay you back somehow...

00:11:38.820 --> 00:11:41.690
If you want to thank me,

00:11:41.690 --> 00:11:46.590
I'd rather have some Century Soup 
than the food at your restaurant.

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:51.570
Right!

00:11:52.430 --> 00:11:54.470
Let's do this!

00:11:55.100 --> 00:11:56.900
Chef Komatsu, we need to talk!

00:11:56.900 --> 00:11:58.170
Where have you...

00:11:58.870 --> 00:12:01.070
What's with this penguin?

00:12:01.070 --> 00:12:02.980
Wait, Kuruppo!

00:12:02.980 --> 00:12:08.280
I'm from Gourmet TV, and I'll be doing 
an in-depth story on Chef Komatsu!

00:12:08.520 --> 00:12:11.150
Please feel free to film 
from outside the kitchen!

00:12:11.450 --> 00:12:13.550
Thank you, Komatsu-kun!

00:12:14.990 --> 00:12:16.820
I'll be expecting good things.

00:12:16.820 --> 00:12:20.290
I wonder how many years it'll 
take you to perfect it...

00:12:20.890 --> 00:12:24.630
This is the symbol of Life, 
the healing tree, Mother Wood.

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:27.100
Master!

00:12:27.700 --> 00:12:33.310
I see. So that's why you went and 
brought Toriko and the others here.

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:37.540
I'm beggin' you, Master! Cure 
Toriko and the others' wounds!

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:40.450
Better than being burnt to a 
crisp by Granny Setsu, you know?

00:12:40.450 --> 00:12:42.150
Of course!

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:47.050
Anything in this world would be better 
than gettin' punished by Granny Setsu.

00:12:47.050 --> 00:12:50.560
My dad knows this old guy?

00:12:50.560 --> 00:12:53.160
This man has the healing medicine...

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:56.060
This crude, utterly un-beautiful old fart...

00:12:56.060 --> 00:12:58.660
Does he really know about Earth?

00:12:59.200 --> 00:13:03.300
I don't really care, but I'm getting hungry.

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:06.770
Right. This way.

00:13:07.610 --> 00:13:10.140
This is inside the Mother Wood.

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:12.740
Also known as the "Gourmet Inn".

00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:18.480
It's a healing space where 
many Gourmet Revivers live.

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:23.420
There are a lot of well-known Revivers here.

00:13:23.420 --> 00:13:25.090
And there are a lot of newcomers

00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:28.390
who wish to become those 
Revivers' disciples as well.

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:32.860
It's a place where requests to revive 
ingredients come from around the world.

00:13:32.860 --> 00:13:34.300
Hey!

00:13:34.300 --> 00:13:36.770
Hurry up, over here.

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:40.200
This is?

00:13:40.200 --> 00:13:42.370
This is my Revival Workshop.

00:13:43.140 --> 00:13:46.210
Revival Workshop? Or place of destruction?

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:48.780
Come on, get in.

00:13:51.780 --> 00:13:53.480
T-This is...

00:14:04.060 --> 00:14:06.030
Come on, get in.

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:11.130
T-This is...

00:14:16.840 --> 00:14:20.640
Ch-Chako Bird and Morning Rose!

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:23.610
Incredible ingredients are being revived!

00:14:23.610 --> 00:14:26.950
But, what's with these marks of violence?

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:28.880
That's the result of failures.

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:31.020
Failures?

00:14:31.650 --> 00:14:35.360
Ryu-chan doin' good, Mr. Gourmet Mafia?

00:14:35.660 --> 00:14:39.390
Okay! I basically understand the goal here.

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:42.530
It's simple, so let's get it started already!

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:48.400
However, I apologize if I fail!

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:50.470
Wake Up Shock!

00:14:58.350 --> 00:15:00.680
Rough as always...

00:15:00.680 --> 00:15:03.020
But his skills are undeniable.

00:15:03.020 --> 00:15:07.190
Rise and shine! It's morning, Mafia boys!

00:15:11.290 --> 00:15:12.790
You guys!

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:15.260
Let's heal those wounds!

00:15:16.900 --> 00:15:18.370
They've been eaten!

00:15:18.370 --> 00:15:22.340
Don't worry, that's a rare Pelican Gogusa.

00:15:22.340 --> 00:15:26.240
It's a plant that eats the 
wounds of people and animals.

00:15:26.240 --> 00:15:29.240
They'll completely heal a great 
deal of wounds in one minute flat.

00:15:30.080 --> 00:15:33.510
Looks like your wounds haven't 
completely healed either.

00:15:33.510 --> 00:15:35.280
Paste Spittle!

00:15:36.480 --> 00:15:38.080
He spit at me!

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:41.350
Wait a bit and that wound'll heal.

00:15:41.350 --> 00:15:44.190
Your leg isn't fully healed either, is it?

00:15:44.190 --> 00:15:45.590
Don't even...

00:15:47.990 --> 00:15:49.530
What the hell have you spit on me?

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:53.130
I put on some that's especially effective!

00:15:53.130 --> 00:15:55.600
Now, what did you want again?

00:15:57.970 --> 00:16:00.140
Healing medicine, was it?

00:16:00.370 --> 00:16:05.580
The medicine that will heal any 
illness... It definitely exists.

00:16:06.350 --> 00:16:10.420
However, the viruses and illnesses 
that come in from the Gourmet World,

00:16:10.420 --> 00:16:13.750
in other words, the things known 
as "Curses" in the Human World,

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:16.690
cannot be fully healed.

00:16:17.190 --> 00:16:21.790
Like those eyes of yours...

00:16:23.630 --> 00:16:24.760
Takimaru...

00:16:24.760 --> 00:16:27.030
Do you still want it?

00:16:27.030 --> 00:16:30.940
I just happen to have some. You 
can have it for 10 billion.

00:16:32.240 --> 00:16:36.110
You want to heal Aimaru's illness 
with that medicine, right?

00:16:37.780 --> 00:16:40.440
You noticed, didn't you, Toriko-san?

00:16:40.440 --> 00:16:42.180
What are you talking about?

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:46.280
In the Gourmet Age, we have carnivores 
and herbivores, of course,

00:16:46.280 --> 00:16:49.390
but we also have those who only eat seafood,

00:16:49.390 --> 00:16:52.260
or those who only eat spicy food.

00:16:52.260 --> 00:16:54.690
There are many different types of eating.

00:16:55.160 --> 00:17:00.230
Aimaru has a special body that 
can eat illnesses and viruses.

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:03.900
He's an illnessivore, so to speak.

00:17:04.530 --> 00:17:09.370
Because of his constitution and the 
Gourmet Knight spirit of giving,

00:17:09.370 --> 00:17:14.310
Aimaru has cured many patients 
who were suffering from diseases.

00:17:14.310 --> 00:17:17.510
I was one of those patients.

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:22.890
I was afflicted with an unknown disease 
that didn't come from the Human World

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:25.590
and was told that I had one month to live.

00:17:26.660 --> 00:17:32.060
That disease was called a "Curse" 
and it was absolutely incurable,

00:17:32.060 --> 00:17:34.530
and because of that, I was abandoned, 
even by the people around me.

00:17:38.230 --> 00:17:41.100
Soon, I was on my own.

00:17:41.540 --> 00:17:44.510
It isn't dying that's really sad.

00:17:44.770 --> 00:17:47.040
It's being alone to the end.

00:17:47.880 --> 00:17:51.850
I was crying alone when 
someone reached out to me...

00:17:51.850 --> 00:17:53.720
It was Aimaru-san.

00:18:04.630 --> 00:18:08.100
So did he cure you?

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:08.830
Yes.

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:10.970
But your left eye...

00:18:10.970 --> 00:18:13.730
The Gourmet World's disease was 
an extremely difficult one,

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:15.600
so I couldn't be cured completely.

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:22.280
But when everyone had turned their 
backs on me, Aimaru-san saved my life,

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:25.210
so he means the world to me.

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:30.480
And now he's the one that's 
afflicted with illness, huh?

00:18:30.480 --> 00:18:32.620
He's cured people of diseases for many years,

00:18:32.620 --> 00:18:35.820
but the accumulated poisons must 
have spread throughout his body.

00:18:35.820 --> 00:18:40.130
So, you want the medicine or not?

00:18:45.330 --> 00:18:46.330
Please give it to me!

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:48.770
I swear I'll pay you, even 
it takes the rest of my life!

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:51.600
Please let me have it!

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:55.710
It may not be able to cure the 
Curse, but you still want it?

00:18:56.240 --> 00:18:58.380
It might not cure it...

00:18:58.380 --> 00:19:03.180
But if there's even a .1% 
chance that it <i>will</i>...

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:07.390
...then I'm sure Aimaru-san will take 
that "incurable" established opinion...

00:19:07.390 --> 00:19:11.620
...that <i>rule</i>... and he'll break it!

00:19:14.930 --> 00:19:17.060
Well said!

00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:21.570
I like you, man!

00:19:21.570 --> 00:19:24.540
That's right! Break that idiotic rule!

00:19:24.540 --> 00:19:27.140
If you don't, there'll be 
a future you can't see!

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:30.780
And the mark of that future 
will be a new rule!

00:19:30.780 --> 00:19:33.010
Take the medicine! I don't need the money!

00:19:33.010 --> 00:19:35.780
That spirit of yours is plenty!

00:19:37.720 --> 00:19:39.720
Th-Thank you!

00:19:41.190 --> 00:19:43.050
Good for you, Takimaru!

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:46.620
It's a real tear-jerker...

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:49.060
And that old man's a helluva good guy!

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:49.560
Rin!

00:19:49.560 --> 00:19:51.730
Toriko! Are you okay?!

00:19:51.730 --> 00:19:53.400
That looks like it must kill!

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:54.130
H-Hey!

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:55.570
What are <i>you</i> doing here?!

00:19:55.570 --> 00:19:59.840
Coco filled me in and I 
just couldn't sit still!

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:02.610
I had Johannes give me a ride in the chopper.

00:20:02.810 --> 00:20:05.980
Rin-san, you're a slave driver!

00:20:05.980 --> 00:20:08.480
Then Komatsu must've gotten home...

00:20:08.480 --> 00:20:11.620
I bet he's in the middle of making 
Century Soup right about now...

00:20:11.620 --> 00:20:14.220
More importantly, can this wound be healed?

00:20:14.220 --> 00:20:17.150
Yeah, I was just about to have it revived...

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:19.360
...by this man, Yosaku!

00:20:20.420 --> 00:20:21.890
By this old man?!

00:20:21.890 --> 00:20:23.090
Problem with that?

00:20:23.090 --> 00:20:24.360
Seriously, please help him!

00:20:24.360 --> 00:20:27.300
I want you to totally fix Toriko's arm!

00:20:27.300 --> 00:20:28.530
'Cause if you don't,

00:20:28.530 --> 00:20:33.340
I'll pour the super-pungent Devil 
Dorian fragrance all over you!

00:20:33.340 --> 00:20:35.640
When it comes to scary, you're 
second, after Granny Setsu.

00:20:35.640 --> 00:20:37.810
Anyway, Toriko...

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:41.010
This is our first meeting, but I see...

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:43.310
You've got a thoroughly thriving lifeforce.

00:20:43.310 --> 00:20:46.250
I'll give you back that arm.

00:20:47.120 --> 00:20:48.950
My arm can really be healed?!

00:20:48.950 --> 00:20:51.420
Yeah. If you're lucky...

00:20:51.420 --> 00:20:53.260
How long will it take?

00:20:55.890 --> 00:20:58.390
Let me think...

00:20:58.630 --> 00:21:05.400
If everything goes smoothly, perfecting 
the Century Soup will take...

00:21:05.800 --> 00:21:08.470
...20 years, I suppose?

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:10.770
You're kidding!

00:21:10.770 --> 00:21:15.740
No lie. It'll take 20 years to heal that arm.

00:21:16.010 --> 00:21:19.710
T-Twenty years?!

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:25.590
I'm grumble-grumble hungry! 
My tummy's rumble rumblin'!

00:21:26.690 --> 00:21:29.860
Today we're out there: Ack 
SOS, I'm in trouble yes!

00:21:29.860 --> 00:21:33.230
Gotta go! Gotta go! Can't 
leave this alone, right?

00:21:33.490 --> 00:21:36.700
Giving you support and cheer, 
the duties are endless!

00:21:36.700 --> 00:21:40.070
Burnin' up! Bustin' out! Trouble buster!

00:21:40.070 --> 00:21:43.100
Oh my god! A heaping helping of energy!

00:21:43.100 --> 00:21:46.910
When I'm hungry I can't get any power!

00:21:46.910 --> 00:21:50.440
Go, fight! At attention to you!

00:21:50.440 --> 00:21:53.610
Two-way communication!

00:21:53.610 --> 00:21:57.120
The encouragement I get 
from you is my nourishment!

00:21:57.380 --> 00:22:00.850
I want to eat lots of delicious things!

00:22:00.850 --> 00:22:04.220
Our future looks to be tasty!

00:22:04.220 --> 00:22:06.090
Right? OK. Left? OK.

00:22:06.090 --> 00:22:10.800
Be careful, courageously! Right on, let's go!

00:22:10.800 --> 00:22:14.370
Fight with bravery!

00:22:14.370 --> 00:22:18.070
Deli-deli delicious, and let's eat!

00:22:22.540 --> 00:22:24.440
Gourmet News!

00:22:25.310 --> 00:22:27.180
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:27.180 --> 00:22:33.790
Cuticle Berries are a delicious 
fruit that made Sunny's hair glossy,

00:22:34.020 --> 00:22:37.360
but I'm going to show you how 
even this store-bought strawberry

00:22:37.360 --> 00:22:40.560
can taste twice as yummy just 
by adding something to it.

00:22:40.560 --> 00:22:44.060
All you have to do is put some nori 
boiled in soy sauce on the strawberry...

00:22:45.900 --> 00:22:48.470
It tastes like kiwi!

00:22:48.870 --> 00:22:51.940
You get the taste of two 
fruits for the price of one!

00:22:51.940 --> 00:22:55.970
That's berry, berry good!

00:22:57.110 --> 00:23:00.810
Huh? Even though I escaped 
from Ice Hell last week...

00:23:00.810 --> 00:23:01.550
It's freezing!

00:23:02.310 --> 00:23:04.350
Now, on to the next story!

00:23:07.200 --> 00:23:09.990
Making the soup is really going to take that long?

00:23:09.990 --> 00:23:12.720
Granny Setsu, isn't there any other way?!

00:23:13.360 --> 00:23:16.490
Race to Finish! Will It Be Toriko's Recovery, or Komatsu's Soup?!

00:23:16.810 --> 00:23:18.430
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
